### rejestracja
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Marta.Lis@example.com",
  "password": "bardzo-dlugie-haslo"
}

### rejestracja z rolą
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rola@example.com",
  "password": "bardzo-dlugie-haslo",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### za krótkie hasło
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "krotkie@example.com",
  "password": "krotkie"
}

### ten sam email innymi literami
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marta.lis@example.com",
  "password": "inne-dlugie-haslo"
}

