### nowa rezerwacja Jana
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginJan.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-20T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### body z userId
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginJan.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-21T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-21T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### body z reservedBy
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginJan.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Jan Kowalski",
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-21T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-21T12:00:00.000Z"
}


